  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.5.2 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Features\n* ci: attest build provenance for release archives by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/95\n* ci: pin GitHub Actions to commit SHAs by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/96\n### Bug Fixes\n* fix(release): use install_steps for the Homebrew cask postflight hook by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/104\n### Other Changes\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/tidwall/gjson from 1.19.0 to 1.20.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/98\n* chore(deps): bump goreleaser/goreleaser-action from 7.2.3 to 7.3.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/100\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.60.1 to 1.61.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/102\n* ci(dependabot): auto-merge with squash by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/105\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/compare/v0.5.1...v0.5.2\n\n",
